<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The DQ Classic Hot Dog — Simplicity Done Right</h2>
  <p>The Classic Hot Dog is the most affordable hot food item on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>. At $3.99, it delivers a quality all-beef hot dog in a steamed bun — no frills, just a well-executed hot dog. It is the base from which the <a href="/items/chili-cheese-dog">Chili Cheese Dog</a> builds, adding chili and melted cheese for $1.00 more.</p>

  <h2>Hot Dog vs. Chili Cheese Dog — Which to Order</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Best For</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Classic Hot Dog</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>330 cal</td><td>Clean, simple, lowest price</td></tr><tr><td>Chili Cheese Dog</td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>420 cal</td><td>Adds chili + cheese — $1 more, 90 extra cal</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
  <p>The Classic Hot Dog is the right pick when you want a quick, light, inexpensive hot item. The <a href="/items/chili-cheese-dog">Chili Cheese Dog</a> is a better meal — more flavor and more calories for just $1 more. If you are hungry, upgrade. If you want something light and simple, stay with the Classic.</p>

  <h2>2-for-$5 Value</h2>
  <p>The Classic Hot Dog is eligible for the <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a>. Two hot dogs for $5.00 is an excellent value — that is $2.50 per dog, $1.49 off the regular price. Alternatively, pair one hot dog with <a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries</a> for a complete meal at $5.00.</p>

  <h2>Condiment Options</h2>
  <p>DQ provides condiments on the side for the Classic Hot Dog. Standard options include ketchup, yellow mustard, and chopped onion. Some locations also offer relish or pickle slices — ask your crew what is available at your location.</p>

  <h2>Related Items</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/chili-cheese-dog">Chili Cheese Dog — $4.99 (same dog + chili + cheese)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match (Hot Dog eligible)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger — $6.39</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/burgers-sandwiches">All DQ Burgers &amp; Sandwiches</a></li>
  </ul>
